#
#
# This is the track title/album name/artist display
# I really wanted to use my custom font for this, but loading every letter of the alphabet + special characters
# as a BMP seemed really, just really damn stupid.
# So I made a font! Called DAP393 (like the theme).
# This theme contains two versions: 6-DAP393 (The 1px version) and 11-DAP393 (the 2px version)
# This menu uses 6-DAP393
#
%Vl(track_title_display,43,99,67,18,2)
%Vb(-)
%Vf(F3381F)
%s%?it<%it|%fn>
#
%Vl(album_display,43,112,69,18,2)
%Vb(-)
%Vf(FBBC36)
%s%?id<%id| >
#
%Vl(artist_display,43,125,76,18,2)
%Vb(-)
%Vf(FBBC36)
%s%?ia<%ia| >
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
# And this is it, the end of the line.
#
# "Well, I hope you enjoyed our time together today. You know, it seems harder and harder to sit back and enjoy the
# finer things in life. Well, 'till next time, ta ta"